{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-04-25 07:31:00', 'title': 'GENERAC ISSUES 2022 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE REPORT', 'text': 'WAUKESHA, WIS. , APRIL 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAC HOLDINGS INC.\xa0("GENERAC") (NYSE: GNRC), A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER AND MANUFACTURER OF ENERGY TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AND OTHER POWER PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ISSUANCE OF THE COMPANY\'S ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT FOR THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}